    prompt: `Create a production-ready Next.js 14+ application scaffold:\n\nProject Setup:\n- Initialize with create-next-app (App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, ESLint)\n- Folder structure:\n  app/(marketing)/ — public pages (landing, about, pricing)\n  app/(dashboard)/ — authenticated pages\n  app/api/ — API routes and server actions\n  components/ui/ — shared UI components (buttons, inputs, cards)\n  components/forms/ — form components with validation\n  lib/ — utilities, database client, auth config\n  prisma/ — schema and migrations\n\nDatabase Layer (Prisma):\n- schema.prisma with User, Session, Account models (Auth.js compatible)\n- Add 2-3 domain models (e.g., Project, Task, Team) with relations\n- Migration workflow: npx prisma migrate dev → generate → studio\n- Seed script with realistic test data\n- Database provider: PostgreSQL (or SQLite for quick start)\n\nAuthentication (Auth.js v5):\n- Email/password with credentials provider\n- OAuth: GitHub + Google providers configured\n- Middleware for route protection (matcher config)\n- Session callbacks for role/permission injection\n- Auth-aware components: SignedIn, SignedOut, useSession\n\nServer Actions:\n- Form actions with useFormState for validation feedback\n- Revalidation: revalidatePath after mutations\n- Optimistic updates with useOptimistic\n- Error handling: return typed errors, display with toast\n\nUI Components:\n- Layout: sidebar navigation + top bar + main content area\n- Data table with sorting, filtering, pagination (server-side)\n- Modal/dialog with parallel route interception\n- Toast notifications (sonner or custom)\n- Form components with React Hook Form + Zod validation\n\nAPI Design:\n- tRPC or Server Actions for type-safe client-server communication\n- Rate limiting with upstash-ratelimit\n- File upload with UploadThing or S3 presigned URLs\n\nPerformance:\n- Streaming with React Suspense boundaries\n- Partial prerendering where appropriate\n- Image optimization with next/image (remote patterns configured)\n- Font optimization with next/font (Inter as default)\n\nTesting:\n- Unit: Vitest + React Testing Library\n- E2E: Playwright with auth setup\n- Component: Storybook for UI component development\n\nDeployment:\n- Vercel deployment configuration\n- Environment variables checklist\n- Database connection string management\n\nProvide the complete scaffold with all configuration files and 2-3 page implementations.`,
